</div>

	<p>After daylight verification, proceed with testing electrical and mechanical items:</p>
	<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Electrical items:</strong> Test all electrical items such as lights, appliances, and electronics to ensure they are functioning correctly. This may involve plugging them in and checking for proper operation.</span></li>
