		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Assembling:</strong> If applicable, assemble the furniture according to the manufacturer's instructions, ensuring a proper and secure setup.</span></li>
